Sensor Identification & Classification Attribution:
The dynamic hardware sensor discovery and classification engine in
`scripts/sensor_daemon.py` adapts the Linux sensor identification hierarchy
and `/sys` / `/proc` / `hwmon` / `drm` classification algorithms from the
KDE Plasma `ksystemstats` and `libksysguard` projects:
- https://invent.kde.org/plasma/ksystemstats
- https://invent.kde.org/plasma/libksysguard
Copyright (c) KDE Project Contributors, licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later /
LGPL-2.1-or-later.

Circular Gauge Rendering Attribution:
Supersampled capsule-arc tachometer rendering inspired by `tordex/nvtop`
(MIT License) and KDE Plasma Sensor Faces (`org.kde.ksysguard.piechart`).

